{"ID":"20240515131412-ucfcczc","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131412-ucfcczc","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131412-ucfcczc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140644-8oh1rak\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140644-8oh1rak\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140644-8oh1rak\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:448,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:448\u0026#125;","title":"061","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162552"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140644-8oh1rak","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 886px;","id":"20240515140644-8oh1rak","updated":"20240515162552"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/04/01"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LJ"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"16歲左右，略矮，瘦"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/01"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服4/25方後仍無汗出，手足時熱，不是一直持續熱。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）大便秘，隔日一行。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）小便黃。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）無排氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（4）無法睡。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（5）月經正常。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（6）口渴重，喜冷飲。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（7）無關節痛。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（8）胃口好。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浮數。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白淡紅。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"耳診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"表實裡熱（大青龍湯證）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"無。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃3 石膏1 兩 杏仁3 炙甘草3"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝3 生薑2片 大棗10枚 厚朴2"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實2 大黃2 芒硝1（分兩包沖服） "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"單位：錢，"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用大火6碗煮成2碗 ×5帖"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"師云：本處方服後若覺心跳太快不適，每服減量。同時服藥後約半小時若出汗後，嚴禁吹風（冷氣）及入冷水中。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患為一年輕越南女子，先前就診原因即是手掌色鮮紅而熱，手臂及小腿皮膚粗糙、觸之有顆粒狀感，毛細孔大而可見。前診師以下列處方治之："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻黃3杏仁3薏仁5 炙甘草3 桂枝4 白芍5 生薑2片 大棗10枚 柏子仁3 淮山3 黃芩3 山茱萸3"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病患主訴服藥後仍無汗出，心跳也僅稍微加快，師認為此乃藥物劑量不足之故。由於汗不出身熱不解，病患也曾依師之囑以孫思邈冷水浴生大熱之法沐浴，仍無汗出。故本次回診時師重新加以處方。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}